---
import Link from '@components/ui/Link.astro';
---

<main class="grid lg:grid-cols-1 place-items-center pt-16 pb-8 md:pt-12 md:pb-16 px-4">
  <div class="py-6 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
      Pay Fast Get Better Grades Fast
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      We made AstroShip so that we can complete students or people work for them in exchange for some money, we are a highly trusted recommended and reliable website, Astroship is working with several other people so that we do not get caught doing work for others, we have several offers such as no AI which means we do it by hand and research it without any AI tools and then we have AI a fully customized ai that is not detectable or caught it uses simple words or if you have any other assignments the AI can detect what words or vocabulary you use and will put it in the work to make it look 100% legit, we can either do the work for you or send you the work so you can write it yourself to make it look like your own handwriting just send us the work at a location and we will give you the work back written or we will send you what you need to write and where.
    </p>
    
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <!-- Redirects to Prices -->
      <a
        href="/pricing"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-sm"
      >
        Prices
      </a>

      <!-- Redirects to Contact -->
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 bg-white border border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-900 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-sm"
      >
        Contact
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
